    "steam_appid": 2433010,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the forgotten halls of a deserted schoolhouse, nothing could possibly go wrong, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/extras/a285569470e1a6979b1c8dd0dcc95561.avif?t=1749796170\" data-has-big /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find yourself trapped in a webby hallucination, you must explore and try to escape an abandoned education facility whilst avoiding unwanted and aggressive hosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need a strong mind and quick wits, as this school has more problems than simple mathematics...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story driven game but with fun minigames and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles that make you think.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interesting and unsettling environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide or fight away the mannequins and other things that may be after you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the minigame-locked hard drives to find out on whats happening! </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the forgotten halls of a deserted schoolhouse, nothing could possibly go wrong, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/extras/a285569470e1a6979b1c8dd0dcc95561.avif?t=1749796170\" data-has-big /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find yourself trapped in a webby hallucination, you must explore and try to escape an abandoned education facility whilst avoiding unwanted and aggressive hosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need a strong mind and quick wits, as this school has more problems than simple mathematics...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story driven game but with fun minigames and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles that make you think.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interesting and unsettling environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide or fight away the mannequins and other things that may be after you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the minigame-locked hard drives to find out on whats happening! </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Set in a desolate forest in rural Shreveport Louisiana, a 16 year old teenager and experienced abandoned building explorer &quot;Riley&quot; finds himself exploring a school with a darker history than meets the eye",
